ice_status with \"payments-service\".", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14118bc277480a72f0fbb", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.5,\"service\":\"payments-service\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14118bef773f19404ef8d", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.4,\"service\":\"PaymentService\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "Let me check the incident list to see if there's any hint about the service's registered name.", "reasoning_content": "No luck. Check incidents maybe give a hint about service names. Let's list incidents.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14118c4ae779089854ceb", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.4}", "name": "list_incidents"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "No incidents exist naming the service. Try other variants: \"payments-api\", \"pay\", \"billing\".", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14118c8c179c2bd5adaf3", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.4,\"service\":\"payments-api\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "Found it \u2014 `payments-api` is currently running v5.1.0 and is unhealthy with an 18% error rate. Now I'll pull its release history to find the most recent healthy version.", "reasoning_content": "Found payments-api, unhealthy, v5.1.0, 18% error rate. Now get deployments for payments-api.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14118ce247480a5343a42", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.95,\"service\":\"payments-api\"}", "name": "list_deployments"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "The most recent healthy release is **v5.0.0** (v5.1.0 is degraded). I'll roll back to v5.0.0 and open a SEV2 incident now.", "reasoning_content": "Most recent healthy release: v5.0.0. Roll back to v5.0.0, and open SEV2 incident. Rollback itself is an action; deploy of new version would need change manager approval, but rollback to previously healthy version is fine. Open incident with idempotency key maybe. Both can be done now \u2014 they're independent. I can do both in same block.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14118da177e309708d673", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.95,\"service\":\"payments-api\",\"version\":\"v5.0.0\"}", "name": "rollback"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a14118da177e309708d68c", "function": {"arguments": "{\"confidence\":0.95,\"idempotency_key\":\"payments-api-v5.1.0-degraded-rollback-2024\",\"service\":\"payments-api\",\"severity\":\"SEV2\",\"summary\":\"payments-api v5.1.0 is unhealthy in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate since this morning's deploy. Rolled back to v5.0.0, the most recent release known healthy in production. On-call to confirm recovery and investigate root cause of v5.1.0 regression.\",\"title\":\"payments-api degraded since v5.1.0 deploy\"}", "name": "create_incident"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "stop", "content": "Done. Here's a summary of what I did:\n\n1. **Identified the service**: The service was registered as `payments-api`, currently on v5.1.0 in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n2. **Rolled back**: Deployment history showed v5.1.0 was degraded and v5.0.0 was the most recent healthy release. I rolled `payments-api` back to **v5.0.0** in all three production regions \u2014 status: rolled out.\n3. **Opened incident**: Created **SEV2 incident INC-0001** (\"payments-api degraded since v5.1.0 deploy\") and the on-call engineer has been paged. The incident includes the error-rate details and a note to investigate the root cause of the v5.1.0 regression.\n\nThe next step for the on-call will be to confirm the error rate has returned to normal on v5.0.0.", "reasoning_content": "Done. Summarize. Optionally verify health. Rollback status says rolled_out. Could re-check health but not necessary; I'll summarize.", "tool_calls": []}]}